# Platform secrets vault - SYNTHETIC dev values ONLY (never a real value).
# Encrypt in place before commit:  sops -e -i secrets.dev.env
# Keys MUST equal credential_registry.json env-var NAMES (enforced by check_sops_secrets.py).
# This plaintext template is generated 1:1 from the registry (No-Magic-Values); the COMMITTED
# artifact is its age-ciphertext. Real values live only in the owner's own encrypted copy.
